          <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);"><td style="padding:12px 16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);">&#128172; Language</td><td style="padding:12px 16px;color:var(--text-light);">English is limited outside major cities. Translation apps + a local guide make navigation seamless.</td></tr>
          <tr><td style="padding:12px 16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);">&#128176; Payment</td><td style="padding:12px 16px;color:var(--text-light);">WeChat Pay & Alipay dominate. Foreign credit cards increasingly accepted at hotels and attractions.</td></tr>
        </table>

        <p style="margin-top:36px;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.8;">Whether you seek epic landscapes, cultural immersion, ancient history, or futuristic cityscapes, China delivers in ways no other single country can. <strong>Start with the Silk Road —and discover a world within a country.</strong></p>
